  "body": "LoongArch architecture currently has limited stack unwinding support\nin LLVM. This patch provides a minimal backtrace implementation that\nreturns only the first frame level instead of attempting to unwind\nthe full stack, which prevents crashes on LoongArch systems.\n\n```\n--- a/src/gcompat/execinfo.c\n+++ b/src/gcompat/execinfo.c\n@@ -25,6 +25,10 @@\n int backtrace(void **array, int size)\n {\n \tget_frame_level(array, size, 0);\n+#ifdef __loongarch__\n+\t/* https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/blob/llvmorg-19.1.7/llvm/lib/Target/LoongArch/LoongArchISelLowering.cpp#L1538 */\n+\treturn 1;\n+#else\n \tget_frame_level(array, size, 1);\n \tget_frame_level(array, size, 2);\n \tget_frame_level(array, size, 3);\n@@ -35,6 +39,7 @@ int backtrace(void **array, int size)\n \tget_frame_level(array, size, 8);\n \tget_frame_level(array, size, 9);\n \treturn 10;\n+#endif\n }\n \n /**\n```",
